  "body": "`reportError(undefined)` constructs an `ErrorEvent` instance whose `error` member will return `undefined`, but you cannot emulate this in userland (as `ErrorEventInit`'s `error` dictionary member defaults to null).\r\n\r\nBased on discussion in https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/issues/33206 we have two options:\r\n\r\n1. Remove `ErrorEventInit`'s `error`'s default.\r\n2. ~Map undefined to null.~\r\n3. Keep the specification as-is. Only `reportError()` gets to construct these kind of `ErrorEvent` instances.\r\n\r\ncc @evilpie @domenic @mfreed7 @nayeemrmn",
